this.toastService.error('Failed to remove item from cart');
```

Now the cart service should compile without errors and all the cart functionality should work properly:

1. **✅ Subtotal display** - Fixed calculation logic
2. **✅ Add/remove items** - Fixed API endpoints and error handling 
3. **✅ Stripe payment** - Fixed configuration keys
4. **✅ TypeScript compilation** - Fixed method names

The shopping cart should now work correctly with proper error messages displayed to users when operations fail!
